{
  "about": "Questions every local business gets. A trade preset adds its own FAQs and can change keys, chips and wording. Keys: a word or a phrase (the widget also catches plurals, -ing/-ed forms and small typos); ':0.5' makes a key weak (alone it does not trigger the answer). Answers of kind hours/prices/services/area/book/dir/pay/contact/lead are written by the widget from the client's facts; kind faq uses the 'a' text ({tokens} filled from the client file).",
